"Error: %@.\n\nTmux 2.1 and earlier will refuse to create a new window pane with a nonexistent initial working directory.\n\nInfo:\n%@" = "錯誤：%@。\n\nTmux 2.1 及更早版本會拒絕使用不存在的初始工作目錄建立新視窗面板。\n\n資訊：\n%@";
"Error: %@.\n\nInfo:\n%@" = "錯誤：%@。\n\n資訊：\n%@";
"%begin without %end" = "%begin 缺少 %end";
"Malformed command (expected %%begin command_id [flags]): \"%@\"" = "格式錯誤的命令（預期 %%begin command_id [flags]）：“%@”";
"%begin with empty command queue" = "%begin 時命令佇列為空";
"Can't open window: missing layout" = "無法開啟視窗：缺少佈局";
"Error parsing layout %@" = "解析佈局時發生錯誤 %@";
"Error: malformed history line from tmux." = "錯誤：來自 tmux 的歷史行格式錯誤。";
"See Console.app for details" = "詳情請查看 Console.app";
"Open in Window" = "在視窗中開啟";
"Open in Windows" = "在多個視窗中開啟";
"New Session" = "新建工作階段";
"New Session %d" = "新建工作階段 %d";
"Bad response for initial list windows request: %@" = "初始列出視窗請求的回應無效：%@";
"Too many tmux windows!" = "tmux 視窗過多！";
"Use the tmux dashboard to select which to open." = "請使用 tmux 控制面板選擇要開啟的視窗。";
"Some tmux windows were hidden." = "部分 tmux 視窗已隱藏。";
"tmux is not in UTF-8 mode. Please pass the -u command line argument to tmux or change your LANG environment variable to end with “.UTF-8”." = "tmux 未處於 UTF-8 模式。請向 tmux 傳遞 -u 命令列參數，或將您的 LANG 環境變數改為以「.UTF-8」結尾。";
"UTF-8 Mode Not Detected" = "未偵測到 UTF-8 模式";
"The \"%@\" option is turned on in tmux. It is not compatible with the iTerm2-tmux integration. Please disable it and try again." = "tmux 中已開啟「%@」選項。該選項與 iTerm2-tmux 整合不相容。請將其關閉後重試。";
"Unsupported tmux option" = "不支援的 tmux 選項";
"While attaching to tmux, some tabs were found whose color is pure red. This may be due to a bug in early versions of iTerm2 3.6.x. Would you like to reset those tabs’ colors?" = "在附加到 tmux 時，發現部分分頁的顏色為純紅色。這可能是由於 iTerm2 3.6.x 早期版本中的一個 bug 所致。是否要重設這些分頁的顏色？";
"Reset" = "重設";
"Keep Red" = "保持紅色";
"Fix corrupted tab colors?" = "修復損壞的分頁顏色？";
"Bad response for list windows request: %@" = "列出視窗請求的回應無效：%@";
"Error opening tmux tab" = "開啟 tmux 分頁時發生錯誤";
"A tmux pane terminated immediately after creation" = "tmux 面板在建立後立即終止";
"Unrecognized command from tmux. Did your ssh session die? The command was:" = "從 tmux 收到無法識別的命令。你的 ssh 工作階段是否已中斷？該命令是：";
